The '''Progate Temple''' was a temple located on [[Geonosis]]. Its catacombs were inhabited by [[Geonosian]] [[queen]] [[Karina the Great]] and her hive during the [[Clone Wars]], until the temple's destruction by [[Jedi General]]s [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]], [[Anakin Skywalker]], and [[Luminara Unduli]], and a [[Clone trooper|clone]] [[squad]] of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] during the [[Second Battle of Geonosis]].

==History==
Located amidst [[Geonosis]] [[desert]]s, the ancient Progate Temple housed [[Geonosian]] [[Queen]] [[Karina the Great]] and her horde of [[Zombie|undead Geonosian warriors]], reanimated by parasitic [[brain worm]]s. During the [[Clone Wars]], a [[Second Battle of Geonosis|second battle]] between the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] (of which Geonosis was one of the most important members) and [[Galactic Republic]] took place. During the conflict, the Progate Temple was a site of heavy bombardment by Republic forces.<ref name="LoT" />

[[File:Karina_hall.png|thumb|left|240px|Karina's central hive in the temple's catacombs]]
After his [[Geonosis primary droid foundry|primary droid foundry]] was destroyed, the Geonosian Confederate leader, [[Poggle the Lesser]], fled to Progate Temple in order to evade capture by the [[Grand Army of the Republic]]. [[Jedi Master]] and [[Jedi General|General]] [[Luminara Unduli]] and [[clone trooper]] [[Buzz]] followed Poggle into it, only to be attacked by Karina's warriors upon arrival. During the struggle, Buzz [[Death|died]] whereas Unduli was taken hostage and brought into the catacombs below to Karina.<ref name="LoT" />

Once a [[sandstorm]] had passed, fellow [[Jedi]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Anakin Skywalker]] and a [[squad]] of [[Cloning|clone]] [[trooper]]s flew to the Progate Temple and entered its catacombs to find Unduli. As they entered, they were swarmed by the undead Geonosians; nonetheless, they found Unduli, Poggle and Queen Karina. After an attempt to negotiate her release, Karina's refusal prompted them to shoot the temple's support, rescue the [[Mirialan]] Jedi Master, and capture Poggle. They barely escaped seconds before the Progate Temple caved in, burying Karina.<ref name="LoT" />

The Republic set up a [[Forward Command Center]] by the wreckage of the temple, and several members of [[Tango Company]] took a nap by the temple, but a surviving brain worm took control of clone trooper [[Scythe (clone trooper)|Scythe]]. The controlled trooper brought the brain worms to the [[Pelta-class frigate|''Pelta''-class frigate]] ''[[TB-73]]'', leading to a [[Skirmish aboard TB-73|skirmish]] with Jedi [[Padawan]]s [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[Barriss Offee]].<ref name="Brain Invaders">{{TCW|Brain Invaders}}</ref>

